OL,3,GNEWSAGarden of surprises and sculptures
OL,4,Awins top award
OL,5,
OL,6,FHistoric gardens that have been
OL,7,Ftransformed from "a lost wilderness"
OL,8,Finto a "spectacular" landscape of
OL,9,Fsculptures and surprises have been
OL,10,Fnamed Garden of the Year.
OL,12,FThe gardens at Elizabethan mansion
OL,13,FBurghley House on the
OL,14,FCambridgeshire-Lincolnshire border won
OL,15,Fthe public vote in this year's Historic
OL,16,FHouses competition.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
