OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAGarden of surprises and sculptures
OL,4,Awins top award
OL,5,
OL,6,FOver the past eight years, head
OL,7,Fgardener Joe Whitehead has led "an
OL,8,Fambitious programme" using organic
OL,9,Fprinciples that allow wildlife to
OL,10,Fflourish, while planting more than
OL,11,F100,000 bulbs and plants.
OL,13,F"We are here to make the gardens sing
OL,14,Fand our visitors smile. That's our
OL,15,Freward and that's what matters to us,"
OL,16,Fsaid Whitehead, speaking of his team of
OL,17,F20 volunteers and seven staff.
